#!/usr/bin/env node
/**
 * Store relocation, in two stages:
 *   1. Brownsville -> McAllen. The pages under app/ were generated by scripts/convert.mjs from the Brownsville clone;
 *      these rules are kept so a re-conversion from that clone still produces the McAllen pages that stage 2 starts from.
 *   2. McAllen -> Rockwall. This repository is the Rockwall, TX site, cloned from the McAllen site (its main branch,
 *      commit 2749672, October 31, 2026): every location-specific value (city name, street address, phone, e-mail,
 *      social links, hours, map links, the live domain, the McAllen storefront photo and the hero composites that
 *      include it, links to the McAllen blog posts) is rewritten here, after generation.
 *
 * The same rules run over the generated pages (app/) and the hand-written files (components/, lib/, overrides/, the
 * scripts that write page copy, the quiz script), so one mapping is the single source of truth.
 *
 *   node scripts/relocate.mjs            # rewrite in place
 *   node scripts/relocate.mjs --check    # only report leftovers, change nothing
 *
 * convert.mjs calls relocate() as its last step. The Spanish dictionaries (overrides/i18n/es.*.json) are rewritten
 * VALUES-ONLY: their keys must keep matching the English clone text or the translation lookup breaks on the next
 * conversion. The hand-written site data lives in lib/location.ts (top bar, footer, contact page, JSON-LD): keep
 * ROCKWALL below and lib/location.ts in sync. README.md is not rewritten: it documents the McAllen build this site
 * was cloned from.
 */
